	(text "DFETOFF, active high (config 0x02): pack sense harness pulled, or supervisor backup, opens DSG. E-stop loop deliberately not wired here: it would deadlock boot (12 V comes after DSG) and drop compute.\nPull-up from PACK_TOP, not LP: it holds with the LP rails down. 54 uA through the presence loop when mated.\nFault injection: test mode, disarmed. Short H-L, H-GND2, L-GND2, H-VBUS via 100R."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 241.3 284.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "bae6076b-0814-5b18-92a5-dd765c9cc9fb")
	)
	(embedded_fonts no)
